00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:24.210
What's a great spot? You'll love it.

00:14:24.210 --> 00:14:25.410
Big fish, huh?

00:14:25.410 --> 00:14:26.460
I'll say.

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:30.000
If you like real big fish, be sure to catch the whale.

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:31.440
to do our best.

00:14:32.980 --> 00:14:38.210
Sure is nice of the Marines

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:39.930
to let us use their fishing holes.

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:42.190
Yeah. Hey, this looks like

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:43.470
a good one. Pull up here, Jethro.

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:51.690
Them whales that Marine

00:14:51.690 --> 00:14:53.840
told us to catch. I've got to

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:55.240
admit them's big fish.

00:14:57.340 --> 00:14:58.140
I don't

00:14:58.140 --> 00:15:00.000
think we got a pole big enough to pull one of them

00:15:02.200 --> 00:15:05.120
According to the sign on the fishing hole, then there is porpoises.

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:06.750
I want me a whale.

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:07.750
Drive on!

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:22.230
The sign says these here are seals.

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:24.510
Well, let's see what else we can find.

00:15:24.510 --> 00:15:26.670
I want me a whale.

00:15:26.670 --> 00:15:30.000
I like them, especially that baby one.

00:15:31.370 --> 00:15:40.320
It's a deity.

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:43.270
Is this where the whales are supposed to be?

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:44.720
That's what the sign says.

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:48.690
I don't see no fish.

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:51.020
Baby, you gotta drop a line in and get a bite.

00:15:51.020 --> 00:15:53.210
Put a hook on my line, Jethro.

00:15:53.210 --> 00:15:54.210
Yes, I'm good.

00:15:54.210 --> 00:15:57.220
Ellie Mae, I'm gonna catch me the biggest whale there is in there.

00:15:57.220 --> 00:16:00.000
Fetch me out a nice, big, fat worm.

00:16:15.680 --> 00:16:23.590
if i was you make better bait unless you can find one the size of a hog don't come that big

